    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this FPS, cute teddy bears fight between themselves with fireballs !!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are... a cute teddy bear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272200/extras/38e8504e5bcd839248823074ba4858e7.avif?t=1750272961\" width=400 height=532 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's you... Teddy. :)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you fight against other Teddy bears online, with fireballs, in a cemetery !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272200/extras/57c7d17a722083b0b642b9dde24015d2.avif?t=1750272961\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>3rd view mode</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272200/extras/2fb8f25216b3ef2bff31f890520ed389.avif?t=1750272961\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>1st person view</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first to obtain 10 frags wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy, isn't it ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, let's go !!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this FPS, cute teddy bears fight between themselves with fireballs !!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are... a cute teddy bear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272200/extras/38e8504e5bcd839248823074ba4858e7.avif?t=1750272961\" width=400 height=532 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's you... Teddy. :)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you fight against other Teddy bears online, with fireballs, in a cemetery !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272200/extras/57c7d17a722083b0b642b9dde24015d2.avif?t=1750272961\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>3rd view mode</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272200/extras/2fb8f25216b3ef2bff31f890520ed389.avif?t=1750272961\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>1st person view</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first to obtain 10 frags wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy, isn't it ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, let's go !!</p>",
